  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Sector Reform Performance Contract for Justice Reform in the Republic of Serbia RS2022AAP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The SRPC will support the implementation of the National Judicial Development Strategy for period 2020-2025, including by focusing on the implementation of key priorities: to strengthen the independence of the judiciary and the autonomy of the prosecution, appointment, career management and disciplinary proceedings of judges and prosecutors, improvement of efficiency and effectiveness of the justice system through continuous monitoring of the caseload of courts and prosecutors&#xBF; offices. The SRPC will thus indirectly support the implementation of the revised Action Plan for Chapter 23 &#xBF; Judiciary and Fundamental Rights, and the accession process in the field of the Cluster 1 of the revised enlargement methodology.</narrative>
  </description>
